      "description": "Watch Red Bull Salzburg vs Pafos highlights and goals from UEFA Europa League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 6, 2026. Late drama secures victory for Salzburg On August 6, 2026 , Red Bull Salzburg faced Pafos in a compelling UEFA Europa League fixture that tested the tactical discipline of both sides. As the teams fought for dominance, the match remained locked in a stalemate for the vast majority of the duration, creating a tense atmosphere under the stadium lights. A decisive breakthrough As the second half progressed, the introduction of fresh legs became the defining factor. Haris Tabaković , who subbed on in the 70th minute, proved to be the hero of the evening by finding the back of the net in the 88th minute to give Red Bull Salzburg the lead. The aftermath saw Pafos unravel under the pressure; Ken Sema , already cautioned earlier in the half, received his second yellow card in the 90+3rd minute, resulting in a dismissal. This late flurry of events cemented a crucial result for the home side, marking an intense end to a closely fought football match."
